I usually keep my stash near the stairs on a level with an altar for doing
BUC. If it is near another landmark like the Quest portal, or a good shop,
so much the better.

When I move it, I'll empty the box that I'm using, throw it all (minus bag
exploders) into my BoH, pick up the empty box, and then just fall down
stairs until I get where I want to go. If enemies show up while strained or
overtaxed, drop the bag, kill them, and continue on. Most ascension games I
only need to move the stash once or twice. I usually set up the first one
in the vicinity of the mines or sokoban splits, then I move it again down
to within a level or 2 of medusa once I breach the castle and clear the
valley.


